                                                "sense_id": "e8839235-81e3-3bf4-a14b-a46b78eebec1",
                                                "text": "Making a cup of tea wasn’t an easy task in this household. The kettle had been taken away by the hard-faced men, and the family were too poor to afford tea bags or milk."
